---
import { companyData } from "@/data/company";
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white border-b border-stone-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      {/* Left Text Column */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-900 font-display tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Tentang Kami
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-brand font-medium leading-relaxed">
          "{companyData.tagline}"
        </p>

        <div class="text-stone-600 text-base sm:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Dengan semangat <span class="font-semibold text-stone-900">{companyData.hashtag}</span>, kami bertekad untuk menciptakan ruang yang tidak hanya estetis dan fungsional, tetapi juga membawa harmoni bagi penghuninya dan lingkungan sekitarnya.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* 3 Core Highlights — text only */}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-stone-200">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900">Inovasi Desain</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">Konsep terencana</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900">Mutu Struktur</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">Standar ketahanan</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900">Kemitraan Erat</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">Transparansi penuh</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Right Video Showcase Column */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-stone-100 border border-stone-200 shadow-xl">
          <video
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            preload="auto"
            poster="/images/hero/section-1-web-rev@2x.webp"
            aria-label="Video showcase Kreasi Satu Desain"
            class="aspect-video h-full w-full object-cover"
          >
            <source src="/videos/hero-video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
